    "name": "RealMailPro API (Zyqentra)",
    "_postman_id": "5b0f6d1e-6a0e-4f43-9a52-4c7a2e9d1b30",
    "description": "Requests for the RealMailPro public API, written from RealMailPro's published docs (2026-11-23).\n\nSet the `apiKey` collection variable as a secret *current value* — never commit a real key.\nCreate, poll and read requests spend real credits. Example responses are RealMailPro's own published examples; unpublished shapes are marked NEEDS VERIFICATION.\n\nDocs: https://realmailpro.online/docs",
